   "source": [
    "# Phase 7: SHAP & LIME Model Explainability Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project**: AI-Based Sales Conversion Probability Prediction  \n",
    "**Locked Production Model**: Random Forest Classifier (`n_estimators=200`, `max_depth=None`, `min_samples_leaf=5`, `class_weight=None`)  \n",
    "**Holdout Test Set**: `data/processed/test.csv` (2,441 sessions)  \n",
    "\n",
    "---  \n",
    "## Objectives:\n",
    "1. **Global Explainability**: Extract SHAP TreeExplainer feature importance rankings and beeswarm distribution plots.\n",
    "2. **Local Explainability**: Generate SHAP waterfall plots and LIME surrogate explanations for representative test-set leads.\n",
    "3. **Feature-Name Mapping**: Map preprocessing pipeline feature names back to clean, human-readable labels.\n",
    "4. **PageValues Contribution**: Analyze the impact of PageValues relative to other behavioral features."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import joblib
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import shap\n",
    "from lime import lime_tabular\n",
    "\n",
    "sys.path.append(\"..\")\n",
    "from src.explain import get_transformed_data_and_feature_names, generate_shap_explanations, generate_lime_explanations\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Load locked production pipeline and holdout test set\n",
    "pipeline = joblib.load(\"../models/best_lead_scoring_model.joblib\")\n",
    "test_df = pd.read_csv(\"../data/processed/test.csv\")\n",
    "X_test = test_df.drop(columns=[\"Revenue\"])\n",
    "y_test = test_df[\"Revenue\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Loaded locked pipeline successfully.\")\n",
    "print(f\"X_test shape: {X_test.shape}, y_test conversion rate: {y_test.mean()*100:.2f}%\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Feature Name Mapping Validation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "X_trans, clean_names, X_trans_df = get_transformed_data_and_feature_names(pipeline, X_test)\n",
    "print(f\"Transformed feature matrix shape: {X_trans.shape}\")\n",
    "print(\"Sample clean feature names:\")\n",
    "print(clean_names[:15])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. SHAP Global Feature Importance & Beeswarm Visualization"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "estimator = pipeline.named_steps[\"classifier\"]\n",
    "explainer = shap.TreeExplainer(estimator)\n",
    "shap_vals_raw = explainer.shap_values(X_trans)\n",
    "\n",
    "if isinstance(shap_vals_raw, list):\n",
    "    shap_vals = shap_vals_raw[1]\n",
    "elif isinstance(shap_vals_raw, np.ndarray) and shap_vals_raw.ndim == 3:\n",
    "    shap_vals = shap_vals_raw[:, :, 1]\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    shap_vals = shap_vals_raw\n",
    "\n",
    "# Top 15 SHAP Features\n",
    "mean_abs_shap = np.mean(np.abs(shap_vals), axis=0)\n",
    "imp_df = pd.DataFrame({\"feature\": clean_names, \"mean_abs_shap\": mean_abs_shap}).sort_values(by=\"mean_abs_shap\", ascending=False).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "display(imp_df.head(15))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Beeswarm plot\n",
    "shap.summary_plot(shap_vals, X_trans_df)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Representative Local SHAP Explanations"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Execute explainability module to generate figures and structured JSON summaries\n",
    "shap_results = generate_shap_explanations(model_path=\"../models/best_lead_scoring_model.joblib\", test_path=\"../data/processed/test.csv\", output_dir=\"../reports/figures\")\n",
    "lime_results = generate_lime_explanations(model_path=\"../models/best_lead_scoring_model.joblib\", test_path=\"../data/processed/test.csv\", output_dir=\"../reports/figures\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Explanations successfully generated and saved to reports/figures/.\")"
   ]
  }
